<rules>
<rule id="a2ca-842f-f02f-3962" name="Allies Matrix: Talons of the Emperor" hidden="false">
<description>Allies Matrix - At the Height of the Heresy. Allies and Brothers: -. Conditional Alliance: Blood Angels, Dark Angels, Exercitus Imperialis, Imperial Fists, Iron Hands, Mechanicum, Questoris Households, Raven Guard, Salamanders, Solar Auxilia, Space Wolves, Talons of the Emperor, Ultramarines, White Scars. Sworn Enemies: Alpha Legion, Blackshields (The Lost and the Damned), Daemons of the Ruinstorm, Death Guard, Emperor's Children, Iron Warriors, Night Lords, Sons of Horus, Thousand Sons, Word Bearers, World Eaters. Apply the chart separately to every pair of detachments in the army. An alliance never overrides army-building restrictions, allegiance requirements or the specific wording of a unit, ability or item of wargear. A Legion fielded with the other allegiance (e.g. Loyalist Sons of Horus) swaps sides: Sworn Enemies that only come from the two sides of the Heresy become allies, and all detachments of an army must share one allegiance.</description>
</rule>
</rules>
<costs>
<cost name="pts" typeId="pts0-0000-0000-0001" value="0" />
</costs>
</selectionEntry>
