<rules>
<rule id="9e2a-1963-0df4-625a" name="Galatus Warblade with inbuilt Twin-linked Infernus Incinerator" hidden="false">
<description>The Galatus Warblade counts as a Dreadnought Close Combat Weapon with the Shred and Rampage special rules. It incorporates a Twin-linked Infernus Incinerator.</description>
</rule>
</rules>
