<rules>
<rule id="6a5a-0af3-744e-b6c2" name="Telemon Caestus with inbuilt Proteus Plasma Projector" hidden="false">
<description>The Telemon Caestus counts as a Dreadnought Close Combat Weapon with the Shred special rule. On an unmodified roll of 6 To Wound, the attack inflicts a Massive Wound. Incorporates a Proteus Plasma Projector.</description>
